 "summary": "Two high-speed switching diodes in one three-lead SOT23 surface-mount package, wired in series: the cathode of the first and the anode of the second share the middle lead. Each diode blocks 100 V, carries up to 215 mA continuous with only one diode conducting, recovers in 4 ns or less and has at most 1.5 pF of capacitance at zero bias. Uses named for it are fast switching, general-purpose switching and reverse-polarity protection.",
